prompt.template:
Create an activity that sources data for the {{shape_name}} shape.

The activity should:
1. Query the impulse state space (via Activity API)
2. Transform data into the {{shape_name}} format
3. Output to /tmp/dashboard/{{shape_name}}.json

Template:
```json
{
  "id": "fetch-{{shape_name}}",
  "name": "Fetch {{view_title}}",
  "category": "dashboard",
  "description": "Sources {{shape_name}} data for dashboard",
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "query",
      "description": "Query and transform data",
      "prompt": {
        "template": "..."
      }
    }
  ],
  "outputSchema": {
    "produces": [{ "shape": "{{shape_name}}" }]
  }
}
```

Save to: activities/dashboard/fetch-{{shape_name}}.json
